Frame-budget implication (on top of existing 4x eyebox steering):
  Simultaneous: 4 sub-frames/perceptual-frame -> 360Hz composite (matches doc's 360Hz)
  Sequential:   12 sub-frames/perceptual-frame -> 1080Hz composite (3x higher)
